# The Veilstone Prize Exchange (decomp scripts_veilstone_city_prize_exchange.s): the coin window (show_coins), the 19
# prizes listed from get_game_corner_prize_data with their prices, the list opening where it was left
# (show_list_menu_remember_cursor): TM58 at row 5 bought twice for 2000 coins each (has_coins_from_var,
# subtract_coins_from_var, update_coin_display), then NO THANKS (B). The guitarist names a Pokémon's Hidden Power type
# (calc_hidden_power_type) for a Staravia picked from the party.
give item platinum:ITEM_COIN_CASE
set state coins 4000
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 20 platinum:MOVE_WING_ATTACK
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_VEILSTONE_CITY_PRIZE_EXCHANGE 4 8 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 4 6 600
+0 release up
until idle
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until menu 600
+4 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+0 assert text platinum:VeilstoneCityPrizeExchange_Text_IsYourChoiceThisTM 0
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until menu 600
+0 assert state coins 2000
+0 assert state bag.tmhms[item="platinum:ITEM_TM58"].count 1
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until menu 600
+0 assert state coins 0
+0 assert state bag.tmhms[item="platinum:ITEM_TM58"].count 2
+4 press b
+1 release b
advance text 600
until idle 600
+0 press left
until position 2 6 600
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press down
+1 release down
+4 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until yesno 600
+4 press a
+1 release a
until app party 600
+4 tap slot:0
until app none 600
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_TALKED_TO_VEILSTONE_CITY_PRIZE_EXCHANGE_GUITARIST true
